WEBVTT

00:00:01.457 --> 00:00:04.250
To put a stop to the Goblin Stampede,

00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:07.916
we took on the goblin dungeon
together with the other adventurers.

00:00:07.916 --> 00:00:11.875
Yet, Fran and I defeated
the Goblin King and Queen ourselves.

00:00:13.916 --> 00:00:16.875
However, in the depths of the dungeon,

00:00:16.875 --> 00:00:21.500
we were met
with an overwhelmingly powerful Greater Demon.

00:00:26.167 --> 00:00:28.167
Skill Taker, he said?

00:00:28.167 --> 00:00:32.667
Now, then,
I'll take my time and torture you to death.

00:00:32.667 --> 00:00:33.875
Fran!

00:00:42.167 --> 00:00:43.375
What?

00:00:44.457 --> 00:00:45.667
What?

00:00:46.625 --> 00:00:48.625
My skill didn't work?

00:00:48.625 --> 00:00:50.500
He didn't take your skill, Fran?

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:52.832
I still have it.

00:00:52.832 --> 00:00:54.292
I see.

00:00:54.292 --> 00:00:59.375
The sword skills are shared between Fran and me.

00:00:59.375 --> 00:01:02.292
That means he can't take borrowed skills.

00:01:02.292 --> 00:01:03.667
Curses!

00:01:03.667 --> 00:01:05.832
Thank goodness.

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:12.082
You seem to be in a pickle, Greater Demon.

00:01:13.082 --> 00:01:14.292
Rejoice!

00:01:14.292 --> 00:01:18.667
I shall summon the strongest elite goblins.

00:01:18.667 --> 00:01:22.667
Defeat that invader and the other adventurers!

00:01:22.667 --> 00:01:25.917
Destroy Alessa!

00:01:25.917 --> 00:01:27.582
Alessa!

00:01:33.375 --> 00:01:35.957
Dark Magic. Black Bomb.

00:01:35.957 --> 00:01:38.082
You bastard! What are you doing?

00:01:38.082 --> 00:01:40.625
Shut up and stay out of my way!

00:01:40.625 --> 00:01:44.582
If you interfere, I'll tear off all your limbs.

00:01:44.582 --> 00:01:46.457
Got it?

00:01:47.792 --> 00:01:49.750
I feel kind of bad for him.

00:01:49.750 --> 00:01:51.625
I'm done playing games.

00:01:51.625 --> 00:01:57.207
I don't intend to stay
in this shabby dungeon forever.

00:01:57.207 --> 00:02:01.667
It's much more fun
to go out and destroy human cities.

00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:06.042
So hurry and just die!

00:02:06.042 --> 00:02:07.207
Teacher!

00:02:07.207 --> 00:02:09.082
Something big is coming!

00:02:09.082 --> 00:02:12.667
Darkness Volteccer!

00:02:15.625 --> 00:02:16.792
Fran!

00:02:23.042 --> 00:02:26.332
Such impact!
Could it be the little girl deep inside...?

00:02:26.332 --> 00:02:28.625
Wild Impulse!

00:02:29.832 --> 00:02:32.125
Darn it! It won't budge!

00:02:32.125 --> 00:02:34.332
Mr. Donadrond...

00:02:34.332 --> 00:02:35.957
Break down the door!

00:02:36.875 --> 00:02:37.917
Fran,

00:02:39.082 --> 00:02:41.082
hang in there!

00:02:47.042 --> 00:02:53.375
(Reincarnated as a Sword)

00:04:17.166 --> 00:04:19.083
(Episode 6 The Greater Demon was a Cheater)
What incredible power!

00:04:19.958 --> 00:04:22.125
So you narrowly dodged that.

00:04:22.125 --> 00:04:23.208
Fran,

00:04:23.208 --> 00:04:25.375
sorry, but I'm getting us out of here.

00:04:25.375 --> 00:04:27.291
He is on a completely different level.

00:04:27.291 --> 00:04:30.041
We don't stand a chance against him right now.

00:04:31.166 --> 00:04:35.375
You're right. I'm no match for him
with my current abilities.

00:04:35.375 --> 00:04:36.583
But...

00:04:36.583 --> 00:04:39.083
If that guy gets to Alessa,

00:04:39.083 --> 00:04:41.625
he'll destroy the shop and the guild.

00:04:41.625 --> 00:04:44.250
A lot of people will die.

00:04:46.125 --> 00:04:47.458
That is...

00:04:49.791 --> 00:04:52.500
That is the last thing I want.

00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:54.166
So...

00:04:54.166 --> 00:04:55.291
Fran?

00:04:55.291 --> 00:04:57.541
Lend me your power, Teacher.

00:04:58.166 --> 00:05:01.416
Here I come! Darkness Spear!

00:05:04.666 --> 00:05:09.083
Fran wants to become stronger
so that she can evolve.

00:05:09.083 --> 00:05:11.375
But that's not all.

00:05:11.375 --> 00:05:12.833
Deep inside,

00:05:12.833 --> 00:05:16.416
Fran wants to become stronger
to protect others too.

00:05:18.583 --> 00:05:22.083
Fran will surely become
stronger and stronger in the future.

00:05:23.375 --> 00:05:25.041
As her teacher,

00:05:25.041 --> 00:05:27.750
how could I possibly hold her back?

00:05:30.625 --> 00:05:31.666
Fran,

00:05:32.541 --> 00:05:34.333
we're not going anywhere.

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:38.166
You asked me to lend you my strength.

00:05:38.166 --> 00:05:40.791
The retreat is not an option.

00:05:40.791 --> 00:05:42.708
Teacher!

00:05:42.708 --> 00:05:44.541
Thank you.

00:05:44.541 --> 00:05:46.583
You seem to be at ease!

00:05:46.583 --> 00:05:49.125
Darkness Blaster!

00:05:50.458 --> 00:05:53.166
She can really dart about.

00:05:53.166 --> 00:05:55.250
(Greater Demon, Lv.30)
Though I said no running away,

00:05:55.250 --> 00:05:57.708
his stats are on another level entirely.

00:05:57.708 --> 00:06:00.250
And he possesses enough mana
to cast magic on a row,

00:06:00.250 --> 00:06:04.500
Moreover, sword skills alone
won't be able to damage him.

00:06:06.791 --> 00:06:09.875
Does he have any weaknesses?

00:06:09.875 --> 00:06:12.208
How irritating.

00:06:12.208 --> 00:06:14.375
I'll destroy all of you!

00:06:15.291 --> 00:06:19.208
Black Bomb!

00:06:20.375 --> 00:06:23.125
Darkness Blaster!

00:06:28.458 --> 00:06:31.875
Darkness Volteccer!

00:06:38.541 --> 00:06:40.375
Fran, get up!

00:06:40.375 --> 00:06:41.875
The next hit is coming!

00:06:46.666 --> 00:06:49.166
Darkness Blaster!

00:06:56.708 --> 00:07:00.000
Are you destroying the dungeon too?

00:07:02.625 --> 00:07:05.833
Curses! He is attacking indiscriminately!

00:07:06.916 --> 00:07:08.500
Indiscriminately?

00:07:10.791 --> 00:07:14.583
Wait. He seems to be deliberately
avoiding that Dungeon Master.

00:07:14.583 --> 00:07:16.541
Why? Is he a tsundere?

00:07:16.541 --> 00:07:18.916
No, that's not it... Think straight!

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:23.500
What is it? I remember
hearing something about this before...

00:07:26.458 --> 00:07:27.791
Aim for that guy!

00:07:27.791 --> 00:07:29.375
Fire Arrow!

00:07:33.375 --> 00:07:35.208
Dang it!

00:07:35.208 --> 00:07:36.083
Teacher.

00:07:36.083 --> 00:07:38.833
I knew it.

00:07:38.833 --> 00:07:42.708
Donadrond, what happens
when the Dungeon Master is defeated?

00:07:43.750 --> 00:07:45.875
The core will go into a state of hibernation.

00:07:45.875 --> 00:07:48.166
All activities inside the dungeon
will come to a halt.

00:07:48.166 --> 00:07:50.250
The monsters inside will perish as well.

00:07:50.250 --> 00:07:52.250
I think.

00:07:53.125 --> 00:07:54.958
Dungeon Master.

00:07:54.958 --> 00:07:56.125
That's right.

00:07:56.125 --> 00:07:57.375
If we defeat him,

00:07:57.375 --> 00:08:01.250
the Greater Demon he summoned
will be disabled too.

00:08:01.250 --> 00:08:02.291
I see.

00:08:02.291 --> 00:08:04.125
So that's why he is protecting him.

00:08:04.125 --> 00:08:07.166
Yes. We've finally found his weakness!

00:08:08.166 --> 00:08:10.833
Our target is the Dungeon Master!

00:08:11.541 --> 00:08:13.500
- Fire Javelin!
- Fire Arrow!

00:08:16.500 --> 00:08:18.208
What?

00:08:18.208 --> 00:08:19.875
- Flare Blast!
- Fire Arrow!

00:08:19.875 --> 00:08:21.583
Fire Javelin!

00:08:21.583 --> 00:08:23.416
She can cast magic on a row?

00:08:23.416 --> 00:08:25.583
And chantless!?

00:08:25.583 --> 00:08:26.666
It burns!

00:08:26.666 --> 00:08:28.666
Protect me!

00:08:28.666 --> 00:08:31.333
Shut it, useless Dungeon Master!

00:08:31.333 --> 00:08:34.332
Don't you have any self-defense skills?

00:08:34.332 --> 00:08:37.832
We've stopped the Greater Demon's attacks.

00:08:37.832 --> 00:08:40.542
But because of the barrier he put up,
he's practically unharmed.

00:08:40.542 --> 00:08:43.917
At this rate, we'll exhaust our mana
before we can defeat him.

00:08:44.792 --> 00:08:45.582
Fran.

00:08:46.792 --> 00:08:48.375
I'm sure you can tell as well.

00:08:48.375 --> 00:08:50.542
We won't be able to defeat him like this.

00:08:51.375 --> 00:08:53.707
So we'll take a chance.

00:08:55.125 --> 00:08:58.667
We'll stake everything we have on a single move.

00:08:58.667 --> 00:09:00.167
Will you be willing to do that?

00:09:01.917 --> 00:09:03.250
Of course!

00:09:03.250 --> 00:09:05.707
All right. Here's the plan.

00:09:11.250 --> 00:09:13.125
Too easy!

00:09:14.207 --> 00:09:15.582
Darkness...

00:09:16.375 --> 00:09:17.417
Here it comes!

00:09:18.082 --> 00:09:20.292
Volteccer!

00:09:22.042 --> 00:09:24.042
Good. Magic Perception!

00:09:26.167 --> 00:09:29.125
After casting powerful magic spells,

00:09:29.125 --> 00:09:30.792
there's a three-second gap

00:09:30.792 --> 00:09:33.042
before he fully recharges his mana.

00:09:34.332 --> 00:09:36.500
If it's Fran,
she should be able to use this time

00:09:36.500 --> 00:09:39.792
to throw me towards him using Wind Magic.

00:09:39.792 --> 00:09:41.207
Now, Fran!

00:09:41.207 --> 00:09:42.500
I hate to admit it,

00:09:42.500 --> 00:09:45.332
but I can't defeat him in my current state.

00:09:45.332 --> 00:09:46.667
That's why...

00:09:47.832 --> 00:09:49.125
Wind Magic!

00:09:49.125 --> 00:09:51.500
Sonic Shooter!

00:09:53.582 --> 00:09:56.875
I'll give everything I have to Teacher!

00:09:57.582 --> 00:10:00.042
Leave it to me!

00:10:00.042 --> 00:10:02.125
She threw out her sword?

00:10:02.125 --> 00:10:03.125
Go!

00:10:04.000 --> 00:10:06.417
Go, Teacher!

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:11.082
I just have to follow this arc,
and I'll hit the Dungeon Master.

00:10:11.082 --> 00:10:13.250
Then victory will be ours!

00:10:15.082 --> 00:10:16.750
So that's how it is.

00:10:16.750 --> 00:10:18.042
Not on my watch,

00:10:18.042 --> 00:10:20.582
you useless sword!

00:10:20.582 --> 00:10:22.042
Teacher!

00:10:22.042 --> 00:10:24.417
You won't penetrate my defenses!

00:10:25.417 --> 00:10:27.750
I've been waiting...

00:10:27.750 --> 00:10:30.167
for this exact moment!

00:10:32.832 --> 00:10:34.292
What a maneuver!

00:10:34.292 --> 00:10:37.375
Ultimate Move! Telepult!

00:10:38.457 --> 00:10:40.457
I pretended to aim for the Dungeon Master.

00:10:40.457 --> 00:10:42.375
But my real target

00:10:42.375 --> 00:10:45.082
is your crystal!

00:10:46.707 --> 00:10:48.917
Take this!

00:10:50.832 --> 00:10:53.292
That was close...

00:10:53.292 --> 00:10:55.792
He stopped me! He's a monster!

00:10:57.332 --> 00:10:59.332
What the hell is with this sword?

00:10:59.332 --> 00:11:01.832
Its mana is getting stronger!

00:11:01.832 --> 00:11:05.707
Hey, Greater Demon.

00:11:05.707 --> 00:11:08.375
The sword spoke!

00:11:08.375 --> 00:11:12.875
How dare you hurt my precious Fran!

00:11:14.917 --> 00:11:16.707
I'll return everything you've done

00:11:16.707 --> 00:11:18.957
to Fran!

00:11:19.917 --> 00:11:21.750
Channel all my left mana at once.

00:11:21.750 --> 00:11:25.332
I'll let you have it all!

00:11:27.125 --> 00:11:30.207
B-ranked Greater Demon,

00:11:30.207 --> 00:11:33.167
just become...

00:11:34.000 --> 00:11:35.917
Fran's experience!

00:11:39.332 --> 00:11:40.707
Impossible...

00:11:40.707 --> 00:11:44.625
My mana is gone...

00:11:46.542 --> 00:11:49.667
You're amazing, Teacher!

00:11:50.582 --> 00:11:52.957
We've finally defeated him at the last moment...

00:11:52.957 --> 00:11:54.500
But...

00:11:54.500 --> 00:11:58.167
My mana has also depleted...

00:12:02.042 --> 00:12:03.082
Teacher!

00:12:03.957 --> 00:12:06.832
Teacher!

00:12:08.707 --> 00:12:09.875
Teacher...

00:12:12.750 --> 00:12:16.957
Teacher!

00:12:16.957 --> 00:12:21.250
(Reincarnated as a Sword)

00:12:22.500 --> 00:12:24.500
Teacher...

00:12:27.250 --> 00:12:30.792
Oh, this crystal is delicious...

00:12:33.875 --> 00:12:37.500
Fran, please don't assume me dead next time.

00:12:37.500 --> 00:12:39.625
Teacher, you're alive?

00:12:39.625 --> 00:12:43.167
Yes. I can restore my mana
by absorbing crystals.

00:12:43.167 --> 00:12:44.625
And I can self-recover too.

00:12:44.625 --> 00:12:47.417
So it's fine even if I take some damage.

00:12:47.417 --> 00:12:49.500
Teacher, you dummy...

00:12:49.500 --> 00:12:52.792
You fooled me.

00:12:52.792 --> 00:12:55.250
I made you worry.

00:12:58.917 --> 00:13:01.750
Teacher really is an amazing sword!

00:13:01.750 --> 00:13:04.625
Not so forceful, Fran...

00:13:04.625 --> 00:13:07.582
- Impossible...
-I haven't fully recovered yet...

00:13:07.582 --> 00:13:11.832
I can't believe the Greater Demon
was defeated by a little girl.

00:13:11.832 --> 00:13:15.542
But it's not over for the goblin kingdom yet.

00:13:15.542 --> 00:13:19.792
I just need to summon more demons
with Goddess points!

00:13:20.707 --> 00:13:23.082
I have faith in my luck.

00:13:23.082 --> 00:13:27.332
I'll summon an even stronger Greater Demon
who will obey my commands!

00:13:27.332 --> 00:13:28.917
This time I'll definitely...

00:13:36.832 --> 00:13:39.042
Dungeon Master.

00:13:39.042 --> 00:13:40.332
It's over.

00:13:41.625 --> 00:13:43.667
Are you going to kill me?

00:13:45.542 --> 00:13:47.625
It's... It's no use!

00:13:47.625 --> 00:13:49.582
As long as I have this Scapegoat Wristband,

00:13:49.582 --> 00:13:51.875
I can revive even if you kill me...

00:13:52.500 --> 00:13:53.200
Oh, no.

00:13:55.250 --> 00:13:58.375
My... My hand!

00:13:58.375 --> 00:14:00.500
That settles that problem.

00:14:01.042 --> 00:14:03.417
A valuable item should be recycled.

00:14:03.417 --> 00:14:07.207
My hand...

00:14:08.042 --> 00:14:09.042
Now die.

00:14:09.042 --> 00:14:11.332
Wait, Fran.

00:14:11.332 --> 00:14:14.207
That guy is already dead.

00:14:25.167 --> 00:14:28.292
The dungeon came to a halt.

00:14:28.292 --> 00:14:31.207
Is it really over, Teacher?

00:14:31.207 --> 00:14:33.917
Yes. We've cleared the dungeon!

00:14:34.957 --> 00:14:38.167
Dungeon clear!

00:14:38.167 --> 00:14:41.417
Little girl! Are you all right?

00:14:41.417 --> 00:14:42.707
Fran!

00:14:42.707 --> 00:14:44.042
Donadrond?

00:14:44.042 --> 00:14:46.750
I'll be putting away the demon's sword.

00:14:46.750 --> 00:14:49.625
I was wondering why the door suddenly opened.

00:14:49.625 --> 00:14:52.292
Did you defeat the Dungeon Master?

00:14:53.457 --> 00:14:55.125
Seriously?

00:14:56.082 --> 00:14:58.542
What's that thing?

00:14:58.542 --> 00:15:00.582
That's a demon!

00:15:00.582 --> 00:15:04.582
According to appraisal,
that's a Greater Demon with a B threat level.

00:15:04.582 --> 00:15:06.125
Don't tell me you defeat it?

00:15:06.917 --> 00:15:08.207
Yes.

00:15:08.207 --> 00:15:10.542
He was super strong.

00:15:10.542 --> 00:15:11.625
No way!

00:15:11.625 --> 00:15:13.707
That's a B-rank monster!

00:15:13.707 --> 00:15:17.750
I'm glad you're all right. I was so worried.

00:15:17.750 --> 00:15:19.667
Donadrond...

00:15:19.667 --> 00:15:21.707
Now then...

00:15:21.707 --> 00:15:26.917
I believe I told you that it was dangerous
to act on your own, didn't I?

00:15:28.250 --> 00:15:34.207
It seems I must reinstill
the ten rules of an adventurer into you!

00:15:35.457 --> 00:15:39.417
Rule number one, work harder than anyone else!

00:15:39.417 --> 00:15:43.542
- Rule number two, do no evil!
- There it is. Donadrond's infamous scolding...

00:15:43.542 --> 00:15:45.875
- Rule number three, cause no trouble for others!
- The hundred review of the ten rules...

00:15:45.875 --> 00:15:48.417
Um, is that his Intimidation skill?

00:15:48.417 --> 00:15:51.707
Rule number four, be a good adventurer!

00:15:51.707 --> 00:15:55.792
Rule number five,
always do your quests with a smile!

00:15:57.167 --> 00:16:04.250
After that, Donadrond continued scolding Fran
until the light left her eyes...

00:16:04.250 --> 00:16:08.375
(Fran, Lv. 25)
Fran, you're at level 25!

00:16:08.375 --> 00:16:10.792
You were level 12 when you entered the dungeon.

00:16:10.792 --> 00:16:12.917
You've grown a lot!

00:16:12.917 --> 00:16:14.875
(New Title: Insect Killer)
You got new skills and titles,

00:16:14.875 --> 00:16:17.750
(Behemoth Devourer)
and your stats have gone up a lot too!

00:16:17.750 --> 00:16:20.875
(Dungeon Conqueror, Goblin Killer)
You're on par with Donadrond now!

00:16:20.875 --> 00:16:22.542
And I've gotten a lot stronger too.

00:16:23.207 --> 00:16:25.582
(Self-Evo 8)
My Self-Evo is at level 8 now,

00:16:25.582 --> 00:16:27.667
and my stats have gone up!

00:16:27.667 --> 00:16:30.332
My skill levels have increased too.

00:16:30.332 --> 00:16:31.375
Fran,

00:16:31.375 --> 00:16:35.500
what skills do you want
to level up with my new points?

00:16:36.667 --> 00:16:38.582
Um, Miss Fran?

00:16:40.750 --> 00:16:42.125
Um...

00:16:42.125 --> 00:16:44.042
You're awful, Teacher.

00:16:44.042 --> 00:16:49.375
I can't believe you were only thinking
about skills when I was getting chewed out...

00:16:49.375 --> 00:16:52.207
I've been found out...

00:16:52.207 --> 00:16:55.042
No, no. How could I? You've mistaken it.

00:16:55.042 --> 00:16:57.207
We made a promise, didn't we?

00:16:57.207 --> 00:16:58.500
Promise?

00:16:59.375 --> 00:17:01.792
The curry, Fran!

00:17:01.792 --> 00:17:03.542
Curry!

00:17:03.542 --> 00:17:07.666
That's right! I was thinking
about how to prepare my special curry

00:17:07.666 --> 00:17:10.250
to celebrate our victory!

00:17:10.250 --> 00:17:13.041
What is curry?

00:17:13.041 --> 00:17:16.083
It's a stew made with vegetables and spices

00:17:16.083 --> 00:17:19.041
and served over steaming rice.

00:17:20.000 --> 00:17:21.625
It sounds yummy!

00:17:21.625 --> 00:17:22.500
And

00:17:22.500 --> 00:17:27.583
let's make super deluxe curry
by adding delicious beast meat!

00:17:27.583 --> 00:17:29.583
Meat!

00:17:30.625 --> 00:17:32.375
I want to eat it so badly!

00:17:32.375 --> 00:17:33.666
Right?

00:17:35.166 --> 00:17:39.041
Curry... Meat curry...

00:17:39.041 --> 00:17:41.250
That was close.

00:17:41.250 --> 00:17:44.500
So about the skills...

00:17:44.500 --> 00:17:45.875
Skills are important too.

00:17:45.875 --> 00:17:47.791
The most important thing after curry!

00:17:47.791 --> 00:17:49.291
After curry...

00:17:49.291 --> 00:17:50.625
Well, never mind.

00:17:50.625 --> 00:17:52.458
What skills do you want to level up?

00:17:52.458 --> 00:17:54.791
Sword Art and Sword Technique!

00:17:54.791 --> 00:17:56.166
I figured as much.

00:17:56.166 --> 00:17:58.458
Magic might not be as effective
against strong enemies,

00:17:58.458 --> 00:18:02.125
but sword skills can come in handy
in unfavorable situations.

00:18:02.125 --> 00:18:02.875
Right.

00:18:03.958 --> 00:18:06.791
All right! Let's max them out!

00:18:06.791 --> 00:18:07.708
Level up!

00:18:07.708 --> 00:18:09.895
(Sword Art 10, Sword Technique 10)
Sword Art and Sword Technique

00:18:09.896 --> 00:18:12.083
(Sword Art 10, Sword Technique 10)
have been increased to level 10.

00:18:12.083 --> 00:18:16.875
Master Sword Art 1
and Master Sword Technique 1 were gained.

00:18:16.875 --> 00:18:20.625
For Sword Technique and Sword Art
have been mastered,

00:18:20.625 --> 00:18:23.833
Elemental Sword 1 was gained.

00:18:23.833 --> 00:18:27.083
We've unlocked quite a few high-level skills.

00:18:27.083 --> 00:18:30.041
Master Sword Art... That sounds really cool!

00:18:30.041 --> 00:18:35.625
Elemental Sword appears to allow you to enchant
the sword with elements temporarily.

00:18:36.583 --> 00:18:39.500
I want to try
using a sword enshrouded in flames!

00:18:39.500 --> 00:18:42.000
All that's left is...

00:18:42.000 --> 00:18:43.625
That skill!

00:18:43.625 --> 00:18:46.041
Are you referring to Skill Taker?

00:18:46.041 --> 00:18:47.416
Yes.

00:18:47.416 --> 00:18:51.583
A cheat skill that allows you
to take your opponent's skills.

00:18:51.583 --> 00:18:54.625
Maybe it seals the opponent's skills too.

00:18:54.625 --> 00:18:56.250
You're right.

00:18:56.250 --> 00:18:59.958
And it can work on opponents without crystals
we've ignored so far.

00:18:59.958 --> 00:19:03.541
In other words, we might be able
to steal skills from humans too...

00:19:04.875 --> 00:19:05.833
So,

00:19:05.833 --> 00:19:09.916
what do you say we level up Skill Taker?

00:19:09.916 --> 00:19:12.166
I'm sure Teacher will make good use of it.

00:19:12.166 --> 00:19:14.833
All right then...

00:19:14.833 --> 00:19:18.791
Skill Taker has been increased to level two.

00:19:18.791 --> 00:19:20.458
Oh, the chance of success increased!

00:19:20.458 --> 00:19:23.666
All right! Let's max it out!

00:19:23.666 --> 00:19:25.833
Skill Taker has reached level ten.

00:19:25.833 --> 00:19:29.916
100% chance of robbing a skill from a target.

00:19:29.916 --> 00:19:32.000
May only be used once on each target.

00:19:32.000 --> 00:19:36.583
After use, the skill can only
be used again after 432 hours.

00:19:36.583 --> 00:19:41.458
100%! That's guaranteed success!
I can't wait to try it out!

00:19:41.458 --> 00:19:43.375
Should we take Donadrond's skill?

00:19:43.375 --> 00:19:46.333
You'll get into trouble for that, so no.

00:19:47.208 --> 00:19:50.500
Regardless, we can't steal from allies.

00:19:50.500 --> 00:19:54.666
I wonder if we'll come across
an annoying old man or somebody with a rare skill?

00:19:58.666 --> 00:20:00.708
I've received the report.

00:20:00.708 --> 00:20:03.083
I've been waiting for you, Ms. Fran.

00:20:03.083 --> 00:20:04.458
Mm.

00:20:04.458 --> 00:20:06.666
First, allow me to express my gratitude.

00:20:06.666 --> 00:20:11.500
I didn't expect there to be
a B-ranked monster in the dungeon.

00:20:11.500 --> 00:20:14.916
Truthfully, the fact that you went ahead
without others has caused us quite the trouble.

00:20:14.916 --> 00:20:16.541
But had you not defeated it,

00:20:16.541 --> 00:20:19.291
we probably would have had a lot of casualties.

00:20:19.291 --> 00:20:21.750
As such, I will let the matter slide.

00:20:22.500 --> 00:20:23.916
Phew...

00:20:25.458 --> 00:20:28.708
We've received the Greater Demon's corpse as well.

00:20:28.708 --> 00:20:33.000
I thank you for handing it over to the guild.

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:34.916
The body has been damaged,

00:20:34.916 --> 00:20:37.541
but it is top-grade material,

00:20:37.541 --> 00:20:42.333
so there would be a lot of complaints
if we let you have it all to yourself.

00:20:43.250 --> 00:20:46.750
Well, then, I have one more question for you.

00:20:47.541 --> 00:20:50.041
What happened to the crystal?

00:20:50.041 --> 00:20:52.583
I figured he would bring this up.

00:20:52.583 --> 00:20:56.333
A crystal from such a powerful monster
is precious and highly sought after.

00:20:56.333 --> 00:20:58.958
Even countless countries would want
to get their hands on it.

00:20:58.958 --> 00:21:00.208
The whereabouts of such an item

00:21:00.208 --> 00:21:03.625
will inevitably
draw a lot of dubiety and questions.

00:21:03.625 --> 00:21:07.916
"Why wasn't it handed over to the authorities?"

00:21:07.916 --> 00:21:11.583
I guess we can't get away
with claiming such a crystal for ourselves...

00:21:12.416 --> 00:21:15.458
It was destroyed when I killed him.

00:21:15.458 --> 00:21:17.083
It disappeared.

00:21:17.083 --> 00:21:18.791
Is that true?

00:21:18.791 --> 00:21:21.291
Yes. It's true.

00:21:24.791 --> 00:21:29.291
I guess you'd know what I'm talking about
if you were a high-rank adventurer now.

00:21:29.291 --> 00:21:32.625
But I guess it's fine
since the spirits aren't causing an uproar.

00:21:32.625 --> 00:21:34.250
I take it that you hold no ill intentions

00:21:34.250 --> 00:21:36.208
and let this matter go...

00:21:36.208 --> 00:21:39.083
Hold it right there!

00:21:45.291 --> 00:21:48.250
You there, little girl...

00:21:48.250 --> 00:21:50.916
You're lying!

00:21:52.708 --> 00:21:56.000
You can't hide anything from me.

00:21:56.000 --> 00:22:00.166
A genius like myself knows everything.

00:22:00.958 --> 00:22:02.708
Who is this guy?

00:23:34.250 --> 00:23:40.083
(Next Episode
The Vice Captain Of The Knights is Annoying)
